  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ENACT II - Enhancing African capacity to respond more effectively to transnational organised crime (TOC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This action will build on the efforts of the ENACT project, from 2017 to 2021 to establish an evidence-base on which to promote an effective response to transnational organised crime (TOC) in Africa, and its impact on governance, development and state fragility.</narrative>
  </description>
